---
import { SITE } from "../data/site";
import { url } from "../lib/url";
import Bat from "./Bat.astro";
import Capybara from "./Capybara.astro";
import Icon from "./Icon.astro";
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="footer-stars" aria-hidden="true">
    <span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span>
  </div>

  <div class="container footer-main">
    <div class="footer-brand">
      <div class="footer-mascots" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="footer-bat"><Bat /></div>
        <div class="footer-capy"><Capybara /></div>
      </div>
      <p class="footer-quote">“音乐不是比赛，是一颗每天都能点亮的小星星。”</p>
      <div class="footer-badges">
        <span><Icon name="heart" size={13} /> 免费 · 无广告</span>
        <span><Icon name="shield" size={13} /> 不收集个人信息</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-col">
      <h2>一起探险</h2>
      <a href={url("/basics/")}>吉他小百科</a>
      <a href={url("/roadmap/")}>6 站学习地图</a>
      <a href={url("/practice/")}>互动练习室</a>
      <a href={url("/concert/")}>星空音乐厅</a>
      <a href={url("/library/")}>免费资源宝库</a>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-col">
      <h2>给大人</h2>
      <a href={url("/parents/")}>陪伴指南</a>
      <a href={url("/parents/#teacher")}>怎样找老师</a>
      <a href={url("/parents/#privacy")}>隐私与屏幕时间</a>
      <a href={url("/about/")}>关于本站与版权</a>
      <a href={SITE.repo} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub 仓库 <Icon name="external" size={12} /></a>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-col footer-note">
      <h2>写在最后</h2>
      <p>
        这是为一位 7 岁小音乐家做的古典吉他学习小世界。没有排名、没有广告，也不催你快一点。
        如果今天的你只想听一首歌，那也很好。
      </p>
      <p class="footer-updated">内容更新：{SITE.updated}</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="container footer-bottom">
    <p>© {new Date().getFullYear()} {SITE.nameZh} · Love Classic Guitar</p>
    <p>
      外部视频与资源版权归原作者；本站仅提供链接与学习笔记。YouTube 是 Google LLC 的商标。
    </p>
    <a class="back-top" href="#top">回到星空 <Icon name="arrow-up" size={14} /></a>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .site-footer {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin-top: 60px;
    color: #f4edff;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 12% 0%, rgba(120, 88, 246, 0.4), transparent 32%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 85% 18%, rgba(104, 211, 255, 0.14), transparent 26%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, #221750, #140d35 78%);
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.11);
  }

  .footer-stars {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    opacity: 0.65;
  }

  .footer-stars span {
    position: absolute;
    width: 4px;
    height: 4px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #ffe9a3;
    box-shadow: 0 0 9px 3px rgba(255, 225, 139, 0.25);
    animation: footer-twinkle 5s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .footer-stars span:nth-child(1) { left: 7%; top: 22%; }
  .footer-stars span:nth-child(2) { left: 23%; top: 12%; animation-delay: -1.2s; }
  .footer-stars span:nth-child(3) { left: 48%; top: 8%; animation-delay: -2.4s; }
  .footer-stars span:nth-child(4) { left: 67%; top: 20%; animation-delay: -0.8s; }
  .footer-stars span:nth-child(5) { left: 87%; top: 13%; animation-delay: -3.2s; }
  .footer-stars span:nth-child(6) { left: 93%; top: 41%; animation-delay: -1.8s; }
  .footer-stars span:nth-child(7) { left: 39%; top: 29%; animation-delay: -4s; }

  .footer-main {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.45fr 0.7fr 0.7fr 1fr;
    gap: clamp(28px, 4vw, 62px);
    padding-top: 58px;
    padding-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .footer-brand {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .footer-mascots {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    height: 96px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .footer-bat {
    width: 92px;
    margin-right: -20px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    transform: rotate(-8deg);
  }

  .footer-capy {
    width: 145px;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 8px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18));
  }

  .footer-quote {
    max-width: 320px;
    margin: 0;
    color: #fff8ee;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .footer-badges {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }

  .footer-badges span {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 5px;
    padding: 5px 8px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
    border-radius: 999px;
    color: #cfc2f6;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .footer-col h2 {
    margin: 0 0 15px;
    color: #fff6e6;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .footer-col a {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    width: fit-content;
    margin: 0 0 9px;
    color: #c9bdea;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 150ms ease, transform 150ms ease;
  }

  .footer-col a:hover {
    color: #ffe08a;
    transform: translateX(3px);
  }

  .footer-note p {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    color: #c9bdea;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .footer-updated {
    color: #9183bf !important;
    font-size: 11px !important;
  }

  .footer-bottom {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px 22px;
    padding-top: 20px;
    padding-bottom: 24px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  }

  .footer-bottom p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #8f80b9;
    font-size: 10.5px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .footer-bottom p:nth-child(2) {
    max-width: 620px;
  }

  .back-top {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 5px;
    color: #d3c8ef;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .back-top:hover {
    color: #ffe08a;
  }

  @media (max-width: 980px) {
    .footer-main {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }

    .footer-brand {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 580px) {
    .footer-main {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 30px;
      padding-top: 42px;
    }

    .footer-brand {
      grid-column: auto;
    }

    .footer-bottom {
      display: block;
    }

    .footer-bottom p {
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
  }

  @keyframes footer-twinkle {
    0%, 100% { opacity: 0.3; transform: scale(0.8); }
    50% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1.1); }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .footer-stars span {
      animation: none;
    }
  }
</style>
